=== parse-hint-on-plain-bar-multi.watsup ===
error[parse/hint-on-plain-type]: hints are not allowed on a plain type definition
  --> parse-hint-on-plain-bar-multi.watsup:4:20
  |
4 | syntax foo = | nat hint(blah) | int
  |                    ^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  | note: A plain type definition aliases an existing type, as in
  |       `syntax x = nat`. It inherits the aliased type's hints and cannot
  |       declare its own.
