=== parse-relation-body-must-be-notation.watsup ===
error[parse/notation-type-expected]: relation body must be a notation type, but got plain type `nat`
  --> parse-relation-body-must-be-notation.watsup:3:13
  |
3 | relation R: nat
  |             ^^^
  |
